					<font fontName="DejaVu Sans" size="10" isItalic="false"/>
					<paragraph leftIndent="50"/>
				</textElement>
				<textFieldExpression><![CDATA["In modification of this office memo no. dated: the vessel is allowed to carry Steam Coal instead of Fly Ash and the protocol route will be khulna-Kolkata-Narayanganj(Via Mongla) instead of Khulna-Kolkata-Narayangan) (Khanpur RCC Jetty) route no.281. The validity of voyage permission is hereby extended for the period from .All other terms and conditions as laid down in the aforesaid permission will remain unchanged."]]></textFieldExpression>
